b-58","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Chatterbox Multilingual V3 (cached `from_local` + ISO `language_id`, PerTh on). Cross-lang `cfg_weight` auto is **0.3** (retry 0.5). Lines over 300 characters split. T3 is capped per line (floor 200 tokens so hush cannot eat the budget); output is onset-cropped (hush / PerTh floor) before fit. Duration lock: ffmpeg `atempo` ≤1.25×, then spill, then fade-trim. First Queue is offline when the clone pack is complete (`Cangjie5_TC.json` + `MODELS_DIR/pkuseg`). \\~40 s/turn on GB10 is sequential sampling, not a leftover download"},"486":{"id":"/dub-59","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"MIT"},"487":{"id":"/dub-60","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`download-dub --tier clone`"},"488":{"id":"/dub-61","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Clone alt"},"489":{"id":"/dub-62","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Qwen3-TTS 0.6B Base (`generate_voice_clone` + the same per-speaker refs). Wheel and weights are **separate**. Missing extra fail-fasts (one Dub status, empty mix). **No** silent fallback to chatterbox-ml"},"490":{"id":"/dub-63","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Apache 2.0"},"491":{"id":"/dub-64","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Wheel: `pip install --no-deps qwen-tts` (extras first; never unconstrained). Weights: `download-podcast --tier qwen3tts` (complete Base + nested 12Hz tokenizer)"},"492":{"id":"/dub-65","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Qwen3-TTS is **honest opt-in**. Entrypoint does **not** pip-install `qwen-tts` on start (official wheel pins `transformers==4.57.3` and would fight Comfy 0.34.6 + torch 2.14+cu130). `download-podcast --tier qwen3tts` with compose **up** installs extras (`einops`, `soundfile`) then `qwen-tts --no-deps`. Queue with **Clone engine** `qwen3tts` and no extra returns immediately: one Dub status, empty mix, never the original recording, never chatterbox-ml. A weights-only snapshot (`model.safetensors` alone) is **incomplete** — Base needs `config.json` + text tokenizer files + nested `speech_tokenizer/`."},"493":{"id":"/dub-66","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`faster-whisper`, `chatterbox-tts`, and `llama-cpp-python` are fail-soft-baked in `phase-nodes.sh`. ASR and clone install **separately**: ASR first, then `setuptools<82` (PerTh / `pkg_resources`) and the Chatterbox GitHub zip (`CHATTERBOX_TTS_REF`, `--no-deps --force-reinstall`) so Chatterbox cannot pin `torch==2.6.0` over the lab 2.14 cu130 venv. Clone `FutureWarning`s for `LoRACompatibleLinear` and `torch.backends.cuda.sdp_kernel()` are lab-shimmed in bind-mounted `pythonpath/sitecustomize.py` (`nn.Linear` + `torch.nn.attention.sdpa_kernel`). Do **not** `pip install peft` to clear them — PEFT flips diffusers' LoRA backend for image graphs. PerTh stays on. PyPI `chatterbox-tts==0.1.7` has no `t3_model=v3`. setuptools 82+ leaves `perth.PerthImplicitWatermarker` as `None` — clone status names that miss (do not disable PerTh). llama-cpp-python uses the &#x2A;*official CPU extra-index as `--index-url`** (`--only-binary=:all:`, pin `0.3.35`, no CUDA extra-index) because PyPI is sdist-only and `--extra-index-url` alone can miss the aarch64 wheel. Direct GitHub manylinux wheel is the fallback (`--force-reinstall --no-deps`) when pip is already satisfied but `from llama_cpp import Llama` still fails. `download-dub` pip-installs ASR, the CPU wheel, the setuptools pin, and clone into a **running** container (volume venv Comfy execs). Restart heals PerTh when the watermarker is not callable. Queue also self-heals `llama-cpp-python` on first miss — no extra restart for the wheel. `yt-dlp` stays optional for URL ingest. The graph still loads if a wheel is missing; Queue writes an **empty mix** plus **Dub status** (never the original recording, never English cloned as the target). Missing llama.cpp / GGUF is **blocking** when Rewrite translation is on and source ≠ target — Queue does not run ASR or clone. On DGX Spark, CTranslate2 PyPI wheels are **CPU-only**; Whisper loads CPU int8 first."},"494":{"id":"/dub-67","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Chatterbox languages: Arabic, Danish, German, Greek, English, Spanish, Finnish, French, Hebrew, Hindi, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Swedish, Swahili, Turkish, Chinese. Soccer EN→ES is first-class."},"495":{"id":"/dub-68","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Banned: F5-TTS, XTTS, Fish, Higgs, NLLB, SeamlessM4T, ElevenLabs, Wav2Lip, TTS-Audio-Suite."},"496":{"id":"/dub-69","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#download","content":"Dub weights are **opt-in**. `./scripts/manage.sh download-models` does **not** pull them. `doctor` prints dub JSON and still exits 0 when the pack is absent."},"497":{"id":"/dub-70","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#download","content":"URL ingest on the host (optional):"},"498":{"id":"/dub-71","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Graph: **audio/dub/clone-translate** (`extra.lab_profile` `us-safe-dub`). Occupancy **audio**."},"499":{"id":"/dub-72","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Widget"},"500":{"id":"/dub-73","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Role"},"501":{"id":"/dub-74","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"**Source file**"},"502":{"id":"/dub-75","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Dropdown of wav/mp4/mkv/mp3 already in `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/input` (container `/inputs`). Default `(none)`"},"503":{"id":"/dub-76","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"**Upload media**"},"504":{"id":"/dub-77","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Choose a local file; Comfy stores it in `input/`. Button only — it does not occupy a `widgets_values` slot"},"505":{"id":"/dub-78","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"**Source URL**"},"506":{"id":"/dub-79","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Optional http(s) you have rights to fetch. Overrides Source file when set"},"507":{"id":"/dub-80","p