"tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Numbered runbook** — copy example env → per-node start → dispatch → concat"},"1505":{"id":"/spark-farm-11","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Three ComfyUI UIs** — Queue seeded lab graphs on each"},"1506":{"id":"/spark-farm-12","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Optional `sync-models`** — rsync `MODELS_DIR/comfy` over fabric"},"1507":{"id":"/spark-farm-13","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**`dispatch`** — local `print-shot` per host, never remote compose up"},"1508":{"id":"/spark-farm-14","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Refusals** — NCCL, K3s, MiniMax H3, H3 Director"},"1509":{"id":"/spark-farm-15","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**What this enables**"},"1510":{"id":"/spark-farm-16","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Three concurrent 5 s** Wan/LTX shots with **one weight copy**"},"1511":{"id":"/spark-farm-17","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Copies on the 200 GbE fabric**, not the 10 GbE mgmt NIC"},"1512":{"id":"/spark-farm-18","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"**Unchanged `restart: \"no\"`** and local heavy confirm on `start`"},"1513":{"id":"/spark-farm-19","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"This remains a **per-node Comfy demo**. Tensor-parallel LLMs belong in nvidia-dgx-spark-lab. You still have **no NCCL** and **no multi-GPU graph** in this sample stack — three UIs, one weight copy, independent 5 s Queues. Why this repo stays Compose: When to use vs spark-lab. Occupancy is **per Spark**: Occupancy · Occupancy matrix."},"1514":{"id":"/spark-farm-20","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"Farm hosts use the example env (placeholders), not a single `${SPARK_HOST}`. Status probe:"},"1515":{"id":"/spark-farm-21","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"`spark-farm.sh` **never** starts compose on a remote node. Type **yes** on each Spark locally. Independent workers may share `${MODELS_DIR}`; that is **not** NCCL. MiniMax H3 names (`*h3*` / `*MiniMax*`) are refused — see licenses."},"1516":{"id":"/spark-farm-22","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"Placeholders below match `config/spark-farm.example.env`. Do **not** commit real hostnames."},"1517":{"id":"/spark-farm-23","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Copy the example env**"},"1518":{"id":"/spark-farm-24","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Fill placeholders** — `SPARK_HOSTS`, `SPARK_USER`, `SPARK_COMFY_URLS`, `SPARK_FABRIC_IPS`, `MODELS_DIR` (and `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR` / `FARM_SHARE` if you do not want the defaults):"},"1519":{"id":"/spark-farm-25","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Source it** in the operator shell:"},"1520":{"id":"/spark-farm-26","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Share weights: NFS vs rsync over fabric** (pick one)"},"1521":{"id":"/spark-farm-27","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**NFS over the fabric subnet (preferred):** Spark-0 exports `${MODELS_DIR}` (default `/mnt/models`); Sparks 1–2 mount it. Compose already bind-mounts `${MODELS_DIR}:/models`."},"1522":{"id":"/spark-farm-28","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Replica:** `./scripts/utilities/spark-farm.sh sync-models` rsyncs `MODELS_DIR/comfy&#x60; over **`SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` only** (not the management NIC). Needs at least two fabric addresses."},"1523":{"id":"/spark-farm-29","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Per-node setup / doctor / download / start** — on **each** Spark, operator, with confirm. Type **yes** locally. Never `ssh … compose up`."},"1524":{"id":"/spark-farm-30","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Probe** (does not start compose):"},"1525":{"id":"/spark-farm-31","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Dispatch** `print-shot` (shots **01–06 / 07–12 / 13–18** on three hosts, or an even split on two). SSH-runs **local** `./scripts/manage.sh print-shot` only:"},"1526":{"id":"/spark-farm-32","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Concat locally** (gather is under `${FARM_SHARE}/out`; concat on spark-0):"},"1527":{"id":"/spark-farm-33","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"Director is **off** this path. See 90s shorts."},"1528":{"id":"/spark-farm-34","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Mode"},"1529":{"id":"/spark-farm-35","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"What the 3 Sparks do"},"1530":{"id":"/spark-farm-36","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"When"},"1531":{"id":"/spark-farm-37","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"**Farm (default)**"},"1532":{"id":"/spark-farm-38","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Each Spark Queues an independent 5 s Wan or LTX shot. Shared `${MODELS_DIR}`."},"1533":{"id":"/spark-farm-39","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Parallel shorts / concat-shots"},"1534":{"id":"/spark-farm-40","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"**Do not implement**"},"1535":{"id":"/spark-farm-41","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"NCCL split of a single denoise across 3 GB10s"},"1536":{"id":"/spark-farm-42","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Out of scope"},"1537":{"id":"/spark-farm-43","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Clustering is **throughput + one weight copy**, not slicing one sampler. MiniMax H3 is banned — see licenses."},"1538":{"id":"/spark-farm-44","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Physical: 3 Sparks, high-bandwidth already up."},"1539":{"id":"/spark-farm-45","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**3-node ring:** 3× QSFP DAC, both CX-7 ports live. NVIDIA Sync → Cluster Assistant. No switch."},"1540":{"id":"/spark-farm-46","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**Star via QSFP switch:** each Spark one or two 200 GbE links."},"1541":{"id":"/spark-farm-47","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Management SSH stays on 10 GbE / RJ45. Model sync uses **`SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` only**. Do not rsync multi-gig weights over the management NIC."},"1542":{"id":"/spark-farm-48","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Shared `MODELS_DIR` (pick one):"},"1543":{"id":"/spark-farm-49","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**NFS over the fabric subnet (preferred):** Spark-0 exports `${MODELS_DIR}` (default `/mnt/models`); Sparks 1–2 mount it. Compose already bind-mounts `${MODELS_DIR}:/models`."},"1544":{"id":"/spark-farm-50","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**Replica:** `./scripts/utilities/spark-farm.sh sync-models` rsyncs `MODELS_DIR/comfy` over fabric IPs."},"1545":{"id":"/spark-farm-51","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Copy `config/spark-farm.example.env`, edit hostnames/IPs, then:"},"1546":{"id":"/spark-farm-52","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"On **each** Spark (operator, with confirm):"},"1547":{"id":"/spark-farm-53","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"Three UIs (replace hostnames from `SPARK_COMFY_URLS`):"},"1548":{"id":"/spark-farm-54","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"The one-click **films/go-see** graph is sequential on one host. For a farm, load **motion/av/still-to-shot** (or optional **motion/silent/still-to-shot**) on each UI and **Queue** independent **5 s** shots — different beats in parallel. Concat locally:"},"1549":{"id":"/spark-farm-55","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"See 90s shorts. MiniMax H3 films are banned (see licenses)."},"1550":{"id":"/spark-farm-56","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"`spark-farm.sh` **never** starts compose remotely. It prints the exact `./scripts/manage.sh start` you must run locally (heavy confirm stays on that node). Containers still use `restart: \"no\"`."},"1551":{"id":"/spark-farm-57","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"The `run` subcommand prints a **films/go-see / motion/silent/still-to-shot / motion/av/still-to-shot** Queue reminder for `--film go-see` (or still-here / switchyard). It does **not** POST graphs. It refuses MiniMax H3 names (`*h3*` / `*MiniMax*`)."},"1552":