ps","content":"Where operator Apps persist (`_user/`, rescue from `_lab/`)"},"1586":{"id":"/studio-apps-12","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Creator widgets: Quality (Lab / Draft / High / Free Commercial Use), Prompt, Style, Rewrite prompt, Seed (unique labels, wired LoadImage / LoadAudio)"},"1587":{"id":"/studio-apps-13","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Occupancy (one GB10 job) — chip at the top of the widget list"},"1588":{"id":"/studio-apps-14","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Lane A (Inspire) vs Lane B (Produce)"},"1589":{"id":"/studio-apps-15","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Handoff chains (still → motion → AV)"},"1590":{"id":"/studio-apps-16","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"**What this enables**"},"1591":{"id":"/studio-apps-17","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Opening a lab graph from Comfy’s **Apps** sidebar, not only Workflows"},"1592":{"id":"/studio-apps-18","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Queueing a lab graph from creator widgets instead of hunting the canvas"},"1593":{"id":"/studio-apps-19","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Knowing which App to stop before you load the next one"},"1594":{"id":"/studio-apps-20","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Following Spark Still → Hero → Silent 5s → AV 5s without renaming files"},"1595":{"id":"/studio-apps-21","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users after `stills/still-draft` has been loaded once."},"1596":{"id":"/studio-apps-22","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Lab graphs are the host `_lab/<lane>/*.json` files (folder-scoped ids). On `start` they seed into Comfy as `*.app.json` when App Mode is the default view, so they appear under **Apps** as well as **Workflows**. App Mode is a widget surface on that JSON (ComfyUI frontend &#x2A;*1.41.13+**). It is **not** a second frontend and not `studio-ui`. A small occupancy chip sits at the top of the App widget list (under the menu if you are in graph view) and shows which family is running, still N of M on multi-plate Apps, and the next handoff. It does not cover Run. Restart the container after a pull so `custom_nodes/ez_studio_app` is copied."},"1597":{"id":"/studio-apps-23","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Surface"},"1598":{"id":"/studio-apps-24","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"What you edit"},"1599":{"id":"/studio-apps-25","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"When"},"1600":{"id":"/studio-apps-26","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**App**"},"1601":{"id":"/studio-apps-27","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Unique creator widgets. When the graph needs a still, **Start image** (or **First frame** / **Last frame**) is first so Queue cannot hide a missing file. Then **Quality** (Lab / Draft / High), **Sample prompt** (20 lab recipes + **Custom**), **Prompt**, **Format / platform** (on Apps that own a canvas), **Style** (`none` = off), **Rewrite prompt**, then **Seed**, then Width / Height (and Batch on Klein stills). Format sets pixels and Rewrite prompt framing; Custom uses the size widgets (Klein ÷16, Wan ÷16, LTX ÷32 — pick &#x2A;*LTX · 16:9 YouTube (1280×704)**, never type 720). **Start image** only when that LoadImage is wired (I2V, talking-head, character tweak, clay, text-swap). **motion/av/first-last-12s** exposes **First frame** and **Last frame**. **motion/av/audio-to-video-12s** exposes **Audio file**. Style is hidden on I2V (the start frame owns look). **stills/still-studio** also adds **Look recipe** and Image model — prefix follows Format. **stills/image-studio** adds **Mode category**, **Creator mode** (100 presets), Look recipe, Image model, and an optional example/reference still — prefix follows Creator mode. **stills/still-daily** keeps Image model + steps/CFG. Music adds duration + vocal/instrumental; podcast adds bed length + Kokoro stock voices; **audio/podcast/learn-episode** adds **Sources**, **Format**, and **Duration** (ACE bed stays 30 s and loops); dub adds source file + upload, optional URL, rights, and target language. Duplicate widgets get distinct labels (Klein prompt / Wan prompt, Beat 1 enter, Bed tags)."},"1602":{"id":"/studio-apps-28","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Daily Queue"},"1603":{"id":"/studio-apps-29","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**Graph**"},"1604":{"id":"/studio-apps-30","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Groups, bypass (Ctrl+B), VHS preview, UNET/CLIP/VAE, hidden shot cards, unwired placeholders (Fun InP end frame, VACE shot B), voice-clone refs"},"1605":{"id":"/studio-apps-31","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Debug, film one-click, unused plates"},"1606":{"id":"/studio-apps-32","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**Quality** is a workflow-global combo (`EZQuality`) near the top of `linearData` (first on graphs with no required still; second when a LoadImage picker leads). **custom** freezes the last overlay so you can edit widgets without them being overwritten. **lab** restores authored widgets. Named qualities (draft / standard / high / Free Commercial Use / ultra / max) may swap UNET, CLIP, and VAE when those files are on disk. They never change size or length, and Quality is not `--tier quality`. &#x2A;*Free Commercial Use (\\<$10M)** pins Apache Klein 4B (never 9B or FLUX.2-dev) and LTX-2.5 steps; on Klein stills with a generic 16:9 / 9:16 Format it retargets to the LTX feeder size (`1280×704` / `768×1280`). Wan / audio / trellis are no-ops for that choice. ultra/max may select opt-in Non-Commercial weights (gated, not YouTube-ok). Inspire desks (no UNET) still show the combo as a no-op."},"1607":{"id":"/studio-apps-33","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Official persist is `extra.linearData` (`inputs` / `outputs`). Each input is `[nodeId, widgetName, config?]` with an **integer** node id. ComfyUI frontend &#x2A;*1.49.6+** (the v0.34.6 pin) upgrades that to a live `graphId:nodeId:name` WidgetId at load. Do **not** persist `\"11:prompt\"` two-part ids — the frontend treats a colon as a subgraph locator and drops the widget, leaving App view with Run and occupancy but no Prompt. The lab contract is `extra.lab_app_mode` (`lane`, `occupancy`, `handoff`, `frontend_min`). Do not require `extra.linearMode` — upstream does not write it."},"1608":{"id":"/studio-apps-34","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Comfy’s **Apps** sidebar lists files whose name ends in `.app.json`. On `start`, the entrypoint seeds every App Mode graph (`default_view: app`) as `_lab/<lane>/*.app.json`. The same stem still appears under **Workflows** in that folder. 90s film graphs stay `default_view: graph` (too many widgets) and keep the `.json` suffix — App Mode is still **enabled**, but they stay Workflows-only. Folders do not add `workflows/apps/`."},"1609":{"id":"/studio-apps-35","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Filenames: Workflow catalog. Playbook: Still to motion to AV. Restart the container after a pull so the `.app.json` copy runs."},"1610":{"id":"/studio-apps-36","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Save your own Apps under &#x2A;*`_user/`**. A Save that overwrites live `_lab/<lane>/*.app.json` is rescued into `_user/_rescued/` on the next `start`; extras that were never in git move to `_user/`. Re-open the rescued file — `_lab/` is the shipped catalog."},"1611":{"id":"/studio-apps-37","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"One GB10 job. Cover art ≠ film ≠ podcast. Every App Note includes a one-line occupancy stanza."},"1612":{"id":"/studio-apps-38","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Occupancy"},"1613":{"id":"/studio-apps-39","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Allowed"},"1614":{"id":"/studio-apps-40","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Must be stopped"},"1615":{"id":"/studio-apps-41","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"`none` / `llm`"},"1616":{"id":"/studio-apps-42","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Prompt Forge, Research Chat, Beat Sheet"},"1617":{"id":"/studio-apps-43","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"nothing GPU"},"1618":{"id":"/studio-apps-44","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"`klein`"},"1619":{"id":"/studio-apps-45","page_id":"/stu