le#docs-style","content":"**Matching** the scan card every operator page already uses"},"2015":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-17","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"**Keeping** Fumadocs + Overeazy Voltage tokens"},"2016":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-18","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"**Matching** nvidia-dgx-spark-lab fenced line-height and inline terminal-green `code`"},"2017":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-19","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"**Remembering** that **AI-drafted docs still need a human pass**"},"2018":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-20","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"**Regenerating** `_lab` workflow pages from `docs/workflow_nodes.py` (do not hand-edit `docs/generated/workflows/`)"},"2019":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-21","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"Canonical conventions (shell, Docker, testing): Project conventions. Workflow: Contributing."},"2020":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-22","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#docs-style","content":"**AI-drafted docs still need a human pass** before merge. Invented product features, TBD headings, real IPs, and secrets are defects."},"2021":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-23","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"Every `docs/**/*.md` / `docs/**/*.mdx` page (including `docs/learn/`):"},"2022":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-24","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"YAML frontmatter: `title`, `description`, `tags`"},"2023":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-25","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"H1 **matching** `title`"},"2024":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-26","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**What's on this page** — bullet list (bold first phrase)"},"2025":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-27","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**What this enables** — bullet list (bold first phrase)"},"2026":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-28","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"Author those two lists as **bold + bullets** in source. The Fumadocs remark plugin (and leftover `docs/hooks.py` `on_post_page`) wraps the first pair after the page `h1` into `.ez-page-brief` via `docs/page_brief.py`. Titles stay `<p>`, not headings (they must not enter the TOC). Do not rewrite the pair as a fence, admonition, or card grid. Trailing `**Who this is for:**` stays outside the card. Quote YAML scalars that contain a colon."},"2027":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-29","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**Inverted pyramid:** outcome and commands first; theory later. Prefer relative links inside `docs/`."},"2028":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-30","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**Workflow details:** `python3 docs/generate_workflow_docs.py` (also `make docs`) writes `docs/generated/workflows/` and `docs/reference/workflow-nodes.md` from `workflows/_lab/**/*.json` plus `docs/workflow_nodes.py`. Do not hand-edit those generated pages. Combo lists must match ComfyUI v0.34.6 / lab `INPUT_TYPES`. `docs-site/lib/nav.ts` injects the pages under Create → Workflow details from `manifest.json`."},"2029":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-31","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**Cinema catalogs:** `python3 docs/generate_cinema_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/cinema/` from `custom_nodes/ez_prompt_enhance/cinema/*.json`. Illustration clips live at `docs/assets/cinema/<axis_id>/<technique_id>.mp4` (Git LFS) with a JPEG poster; the generator links them when both files exist. Compress with `./scripts/utilities/compress-cinema-clip.sh`. Prompt recipes: `python3 docs/cinema_clip_prompts.py --axis camera_movement`. Playbook: Cinema Rack."},"2030":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-32","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**Audio catalogs:** `python3 docs/generate_audio_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/audio/` from `custom_nodes/ez_prompt_enhance/audio/*.json`. Playbook: Audio Rack."},"2031":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-33","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"**Source spacing:** no trailing whitespace, at most one blank line between blocks, a single trailing newline, and a blank line around ATX headings and column-0 fences/tables/admonitions (`tests/python/test_docs_markdown.py`)."},"2032":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-34","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"Safety callouts: `<Callout type=\"error\">` / `<Callout type=\"warning\">` for occupancy XOR, `restart: \"no\"`, headroom, download-limit, licenses. Generated pages may still emit `!!! warning`; `remarkAdmonition` still parses those fences."},"2033":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-35","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#page-template","content":"Operator git clone / blob refs: write `development` (`docs-site/lib/site.ts` stamps `main` or `development` for the published alias). Contributor workflow text (“branch from `development`”) stays literal."},"2034":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-36","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#ezcmd","content":"Interactive command widgets. Authored MDX:"},"2035":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-37","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#ezcmd","content":"Generated `.md` may still use a fenced `ezcmd` block whose body is `id: doctor`. The `id` **must** exist in `includes/command-builder.json`. Recipes and substitution live in `docs/commands.py`. Keep `docs-site/lib/command-vars.ts` aligned with `substitute_vars` / `render_command`. `--tier` is a per-utility **pack id** (Download tiers), not a global quality flag."},"2036":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-38","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#ezcmd","content":"Unknown ids fail the hermetic command tests. Do not invent recipe ids in prose."},"2037":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-39","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#glossary","content":"Source of truth: &#x2A;*`includes/glossary.json`** only (JSON, not YAML). Unique `id` (`[a-z0-9-]+`) and unique case-insensitive `aliases`. `short` is one line (hover bubble + dialog); `long` is markdown on glossary.md. Wrap spans carry `data-short` and `data-category` for the CSS hover bubble (`title=` stays for no-JS)."},"2038":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-40","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#glossary","content":"Do **not** inline a second glossary on a feature page. First occurrence per term per page via `remark-glossary.ts`; skip `code` / `pre` / headings / links / the glossary page itself. Prefer aliases that appear in **prose** (`IC-LoRA`, `NVFP4`, `Hugging Face`, `Blender`) so in-page tooltips actually fire."},"2039":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-41","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#session-variables","content":"Operator fences **and** inline `code` reuse:"},"2040":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-42","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#session-variables","content":"`SPARK_HOST`, `SPARK_USER`, `MODELS_DIR`, `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR`, `COMFY_PORT`, `DOWNLOAD_LIMIT`"},"2041":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-43","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#session-variables","content":"Defaults match `.env.example`. Do not hardcode `<spark-ip>` or real IPs. `docs-site/lib/command-vars.ts` substitutes `${VAR}` / `${VAR:-default}` from `localStorage` (`ez-comfy.cmdvars`)."},"2042":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-44","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#code-appearance","content":"Fenced blocks and inline `code` follow nvidia-dgx-spark-lab (`docs-site/app/global.css`, **Roboto Mono** / `ui-monospace`):"},"2043":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-45","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#code-appearance","content":"Fenced `pre > code`: `line-height: 1.55`, padding `0.9em 1.05em`, radius `0.25rem`."},"2044":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-46","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#code-appearance","content":"Prose / list / table `code`: terminal green `rgb(134, 183, 55)`. Do not apply that color to `pre > code`."},"2045":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-47","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#code-appearance","content":"Keep this site’s `article { font-size: 0.875rem }`, sticky table pin (`.ez-table-pin`), and floating horizontal scrollbar (`.ez-table-hscroll` in `table-chrome.tsx`). Both hide once the table has scrolled past the viewport. Do not copy spark-lab’s `0.82rem` typeset or table `overflow: hidden`. Do not `position: sticky` the header or the h-scroll bar."},"2046":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-48","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Do not"},"2047":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-49","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Why"},"2048":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-50","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"**Hide the header** (`translateY(-100%)` / autohide)"},"2049":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-51","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Sidebar groups must stay on screen while scrolling"},"2050":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-52","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"**Paint indigo / `--md-primary-fg-color`**"},"2051":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-53","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Overeazy Voltage lives in `--color-fd-*`"},"2052":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-54","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"**Hand-edit `docs/generated/`**"},"2053":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-55","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Generators own those pages; `make docs` rewrites them"},"2054":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-56","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"**Add `display: none` hide rules in `global.css`**"},"2055":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-57","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Theme tests reject them"},"2056":{"id":"/contribute/docs-style-58","page_id":"/contribute/docs-style","tags":["docs","contributing","fumadocs","style"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/docs-style#fumadocs--do-not","content":"Testing the docs build: Testing docs. Migration leftovers: repo-root MIGRATION.md."},"2057":{"id":"/contribute/security","page_id":"/contribute/security","type":"page","content":"Security","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Contribute"],"tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"url":"/contribute/security"},"2058":{"id":"/contribute/security-0","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security","content":"Docs-chrome summary of repo-root SECURITY.md — private reporting, no public :8188, no committed tokens."},"2059":{"id":"/contribute/security-1","page_id":"/contribute/security","type":"heading","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"url":"/contribute/security#security","content":"Security"},"2060":{"id":"/contribute/security-2","page_id":"/contribute/security","type":"heading","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"url":"/contribute/security#reporting","content":"Reporting"},"2061":{"id":"/contribute/security-3","page_id":"/contribute/security","type":"heading","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"Scope notes (from the root file)"},"2062":{"id":"/contribute/security-4","page_id":"/contribute/security","type":"heading","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"url":"/contribute/security#operational-safety","content":"Operational safety"},"2063":{"id":"/contribute/security-5","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#security","content":"**What's on this page**"},"2064":{"id":"/contribute/security-6","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#security","content":"**Canonical file** — repo-root `SECURITY.md` (this page is a summary)"},"2065":{"id":"/contribute/security-7","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type"