ault to &#x2A;*`--plan`**."},"3633":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-18","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Tree"},"3634":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-19","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Holds"},"3635":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-20","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Notes"},"3636":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-21","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${MODELS_DIR}`** (default `/mnt/models`)"},"3637":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-22","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Klein / Wan / LTX / GGUF weights + `comfy/` relative symlinks"},"3638":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-23","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Largest. Shareable across Sparks. **Not** deleted by `cleanup`"},"3639":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-24","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`ez-comfy-state` volume**"},"3640":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-25","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Comfy install, venv, lab `ez_*` packs"},"3641":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-26","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"`cleanup` **DELETE** removes this. After a wipe, `start` reseeds from the GHCR prebuilt"},"3642":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-27","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}`** (default `/mnt/comfy-output`)"},"3643":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-28","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"PNG/MP4/audio, `input/` LoadImage, `comfy-user/` graphs (including `_user/` and `_user/_rescued/`), `custom-nodes-user/`, `films/`, `guides/`, `assets/`, `research/`"},"3644":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-29","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Survives `stop` and `cleanup`"},"3645":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-30","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/.occupancy.json`**"},"3646":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-31","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Occupancy desk state"},"3647":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-32","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Outputs tree, never `${MODELS_DIR}`"},"3648":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-33","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Three stores (image / weights / volume) are the mental model: the GHCR image is re-pullable; back up **weights** and **outputs**. The volume is optional — `start` can rebuild the install from the image."},"3649":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-34","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Item"},"3650":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-35","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Why"},"3651":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-36","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**`.env`**"},"3652":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-37","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"May contain `HF_TOKEN`. Recreate from `.env.example` + `setup`"},"3653":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-38","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**`HF_TOKEN`**"},"3654":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-39","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Gated LTX (and any gated HF). Store in the operator's secret manager, not a media tarball"},"3655":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-40","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**Filled `spark-farm.example.env`**"},"3656":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-41","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Real hostnames stay off git. Placeholders only in-tree"},"3657":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-42","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Session vars in this browser (**Your Spark**) are localStorage, not a Spark backup."},"3658":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-43","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Host dirs** — writable `${MODELS_DIR}` and `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (`./scripts/manage.sh setup`)."},"3659":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-44","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Weights** — restore `${MODELS_DIR}` (or remount NFS). Then `./scripts/manage.sh doctor`. Missing files: `download-models` (throttled; `${DOWNLOAD_LIMIT}`)."},"3660":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-45","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Outputs** — restore `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (media, `comfy-user/`, occupancy JSON, films, guides)."},"3661":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-46","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Secrets** — put `HF_TOKEN`