er#host--docker","content":"`MODELS_DIR … not writable`"},"4165":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-29","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`${MODELS_DIR}` missing or root-owned"},"4166":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-30","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`./scripts/manage.sh setup` (sudo mkdir + chown). Last resort: `sudo mkdir -p \"${MODELS_DIR}\" && sudo chown \"$USER:$USER\" \"${MODELS_DIR}\"` **or** `MODELS_DIR=$HOME/models`"},"4167":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-31","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`mkdir: …/comfy/…: Permission denied` during `download-models`"},"4168":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-32","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Nested `comfy/<subdir>` is root-owned (container `mkdir` on the bind-mount) while snapshots under `${MODELS_DIR}` are writable. Cache-hit still needs a writable layout dir to symlink."},"4169":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-33","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Re-run `./scripts/manage.sh download-models` — linking now sudo-heals each layout dir (same heal on `setup` / `start`). Last resort: `sudo chown -R \"$USER:$USER\" \"${MODELS_DIR}/comfy\"`"},"4170":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-34","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`mkdir: …/comfy-user/…/_rescued: Permission denied` during `start`"},"4171":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-35","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Nested `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/comfy-user` (or `_user`) is root-owned from the container bind while the output **root** is writable. `start` needs `_user/_rescued` for lab-graph rescue."},"4172":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-36","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Re-run `./scripts/manage.sh start` (type **yes**) — `start` / `setup` sudo-heal each output layout dir (not recursive over PNG/MP4). Last resort: `sudo chown \"$USER:$USER\"` those layout dirs. Do not `sudo ./scripts/manage.sh start`"},"4173":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-37","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`ln: … comfy/llm/….gguf: Permission denied` then `GGUF ready`"},"4174":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-38","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Relink into a nested dir the user cannot write; the GGUF is already present"},"4175":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-39","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Start is OK — Enhance works if that path exists. Heal: `./scripts/manage.sh download-models` **or** `setup` / `start` (sudo-chown `comfy/`). Do not abort start"},"4176":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-40","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Pending / can't start container"},"4177":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-41","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Docker/GPU runtime"},"4178":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-42","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`nvidia-smi`, Container Toolkit install"},"4179":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-43","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`failed to fetch oauth token: denied` / `nvcr.io` Access Denied on `start`"},"4180":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-44","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"NGC base image pull without login"},"4181":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-45","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Pull latest (default bases are **Docker Hub** `nvidia/cuda` **runtime** for builder and final). Rebuild: `./scripts/manage.sh start`. If you set `CUDA_BASE_IMAGE` / `CUDA_RUNTIME_IMAGE` to `nvcr.io/...`, run `docker login nvcr.io` (user `$oauthtoken`, password = NGC API key)"},"4182":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-46","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Spark farm SSH / rsync over the wrong NIC"},"4183":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-47","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Using management hostnames for weights, or expecting remote compose"},"4184":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-48","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Source `config/spark-farm.example.env` (`SPARK_HOSTS` + `${SPARK_USER}` for SSH; `SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` for NFS/rsync). Never rsync weights over the management NIC. `./scripts/utilities/spark-farm.sh` **never** remote `compose up` — run `./scripts/manage.sh start` locally on each node (type **yes**). Spark farm"},"4185":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-49","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#docker-missing-on-dgx-spark","content":"Docker is usually pre-installed on DGX Spark, but updates or OS reimages can remove it. Prefer **apt Docker CE** (not snap) so the NVIDIA Container Toolkit can attach GPUs."},"4186":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-50","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"Default cache is `/mnt/models` (shared with nvidia-dgx-spark-lab). Prefer bootstrap:"},"4187":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-51","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"`download-models` and `start` also sudo-heal nested `comfy/` (HF snapshots at the top level can be writable while `comfy/` is still root-owned). Do not prefix those commands with `sudo`."},"4188":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-52","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"Manual last resort:"},"4189":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-53","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#comfy_output_dir-nested-permission-denied","content":"Default media tree is `/mnt/comfy-output`. The root can be writable while `comfy-user/default/workflows/_user` is still root-owned (Comfy runs as root on the bind). `start` creates `_user/_rescued` on the host before compose up."},"4190":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-54","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#comfy_output_dir-nested-permission-denied","content":"Prefer bootstrap or a second `start` after pulling this heal:"},"4191":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-55","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshootin