ch)"},"4324":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-46","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime#start--runtime","content":"Large cudnn/torch wheel download"},"4325":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-47","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime#start--runtime","content":"Prefer GHCR prebuilt image (seed, no pip). Or wait for pip bars; host heartbeat every 30s"},"4326":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-48","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime#start--runtime","content":"`docker pull ghcr.io/...` denied / not found"},"4327":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-49","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime#start--runtime","content":"Wrong branch tag, package not published, or private"},"4328":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-50","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime#start--runtime","content":"Confirm tag matches branch (`:us-safe-studio` on `main`, `:us-safe-studio-development` on `development`/feature — see `doctor`). Run `publish-image` on that long-lived branch; make GHCR package public; or `EZ_COMFY_IMAGE=…` / force local build: Getting Started — build locally"},"4329":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime-51","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-start-runtime","tags":["troubleshooting","start","docker","kitchen","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":